CITY OF CHEYENNE PARKS AND RECREATION DEPARTMENT
ICE AND EVENTS CENTER USER AGREEMENT
This Agreement("Agreement"), dated
2013, is by and between the City
of Cheyenne, a municipal corporation organized under thelaws of the State of Wyoming, whose
address is2101O'Neil Avenue, Cheyenne, Wyoming82001("City”), and Cheyenne Stampede
Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001 ("Cheyenne Stampede").This Agreement pertains to the City of
Cheyenne Owned Ice and Events Center, located at 1530 West Lincolnway, Cheyenne, Wyoming
82001(*"Events Center").The Events Center is administered by the City of Cheyenne Parks and
Recreation Department.
WHEREAS, the Cityowns, manages and operates the Events Center and has the power and
authority to lease the use there of to others for the purpose of conducting certain events andother
activities; and
WHEREAS, Cheyenne Stampede desires to use certain portions of the Events Center, as
indicated on Appendix A to this Agreement, and the City desires to license the use thereof to
Cheyenne Stampede for the purpose of holding and presenting Junior “A” Hockey practices and
games (collectively referred to herein as the “Season"), all subject to the terms and conditions set
forth in this Agreement.
NOW, THEREFORE, in consideration of the covenants and agreements contained herein,
and intending to be legally bound hereby, the parties agree as follows:
1.
Premises.Cityhereby grantsto Cheyenne Stampede permission to use those portions
of the Events Center set forth on Appendix A, attached hereto and incorporated herein (the
"Premises"), upon the terms and conditions contained herein. Only Cheyenne Stampede members,
prospective members, designated representatives and invitees are permitted by this Agreement to
use the Premises.
2.
Term.The period of Cheyenne Stampede's use ofthe Premises shall befrom August
16,2013, through March 23,2014(the“Term").Before the commencement of the term of this
Agreement assetforth in AppendixA, the City shall make the Events Center available to Cheyenne
Stampede, upon thepayment of separate and additional charges, for(a)preparation for the Season
and delivery, move-in and set-up of Cheyenne Stampede property and equipment; and (b)load-out
immediately following the conclusion of the Season, ending no later than the time set forth on
Appendix A.Unless expressly stated herein, or otherwise agreed toin writing, all deliveries and
items required for presentation of the Season shall be provided at the sole cost and expense of
Cheyenne Stampede.
